      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you explain why we want this? Currently `build_overrides/dawn.gni` only sets dependency paths, we are not using it for any type of build configuration flags (though I guess there are a small number of build configs that `dawn_overrides_with_defaults.gni` will take from there).\n\nIt seems that currently, Dawn sets its flags depending on the Chromium `//build` flags that are set (e.g. `dawn_use_x11 \u003d ozone_platform_x11`). Why do we want this one to go the other way (Chromium overrides the Dawn flag)?",
